# Celery
celerybeat-schedule*

# Local data. Anchored to the repository root on purpose: a bare `uploads/`
# also matches `app/modules/uploads/`, which would quietly drop a whole module.
/uploads/
/logs/

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
*.swp
